      <tr><td><code>listHolds()</code>, <code>onHolds(fn)</code></td><td><code>Hold[]</code>: <code>id</code>, <code>path</code>, <code>reason</code>, <code>mine</code>, <code>theirs</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>resolveHold(id, how, use?)</code></td><td><code>how</code>: <code>keep_mine</code>, <code>take_theirs</code>, <code>use</code>, <code>delete</code>, <code>keep_both</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>describeHold(hold, &#123; collectionId &#125;)</code>, <code>holdNotice(holds)</code></td><td>Plain-language text and the actions that apply</td></tr>
