  <h2 id="session">createMdbase</h2>
  <p>
    <code>createMdbase(declaration)</code> is the entry point for web apps. Its
    snapshot has a <code>phase</code> that says what to show; when
    {" "}<code>phase.kind</code> is <code>"ready"</code>,
    {" "}<code>phase.connection</code> is the open connection. Its actions
    include <code>start</code>, <code>signIn</code>, <code>select</code>,
    {" "}<code>forget</code>, <code>signOut</code> and <code>close</code>.
  </p>
  <p>
    <code>new MdbaseConnect(declaration)</code> is the same entry under its
    previous name. Its <code>application()</code> returns an object with
    {" "}<code>getSnapshot</code>, <code>subscribe</code>, <code>start</code>,
    {" "}<code>authorize</code>, <code>select</code>, <code>assess</code>,
    {" "}<code>configure</code>, <code>clearSelection</code>,
    {" "}<code>forget</code>, <code>setForeground</code> and
    {" "}<code>close</code>. <code>connection(collectionId)</code> returns a
    connection whose <code>records</code> is an <code>MdbaseClient</code>.
    See <a href="/sdk/connect-quickstart/">Connect a browser app</a> for its
    current status.
  </p>

  <h2 id="notifications">Other exports</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>toPlain</code>, <code>toValue</code>, <code>valueEquals</code>, <code>uuidv7</code>: values and IDs.</li>
    <li><code>loadOrCreateClientKey</code>, <code>indexedDbKeyStorage</code>, <code>memoryKeyStorage</code>: your app’s session key.</li>
    <li><code>isConfirmed(receipt)</code>: whether a receipt is confirmed.</li>
    <li><code>TimersApi</code>: see <a href="/sdk/notifications/">Notifications and timers</a>.</li>
    <li><code>@mdbase-dev/sdk/testing</code>: <code>MemoryReplica</code>, <code>createApplicationFixture</code>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="errors">Errors</h2>
  <p>
    Failures throw <code>MdbaseError</code> with <code>code</code>,
    {" "}<code>recovery</code>, and often <code>reason</code>,
    {" "}<code>details</code>, <code>issues</code> or
    {" "}<code>retryAfterMs</code>. Use <code>isMdbaseError(e, code?)</code>.
    Branch on <code>code</code> and <code>reason</code>; <code>message</code>
    {" "}is for developers. Each code has one recovery.
  </p>
  <table class="api-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Code</th><th>Recovery</th><th>When</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>invalid_request</code></td><td><code>fix_request</code></td><td>Malformed parameters, unsafe paths, an expired query cursor</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>invalid_record</code></td><td><code>fix_request</code></td><td>The write fails validation; see <code>issues</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>not_found</code></td><td><code>refresh</code></td><td>No such record, file, hold or transfer</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>conflict</code></td><td><code>resolve_conflict</code></td><td>The current state doesn’t allow this write: <code>revision</code>, <code>path_taken</code>, <code>duplicate_value</code>, …</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>unauthenticated</code></td><td><code>reauthorize</code></td><td>No session, an expired one, or a revoked grant</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>forbidden</code></td><td><code>reauthorize</code></td><td>The grant lacks the capability, or the role doesn’t allow it</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>collection_invalid</code></td><td><code>repair_collection</code></td><td>The collection’s config or type files can’t be loaded</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>unavailable</code></td><td><code>retry</code></td><td>The replica can’t be reached, for example no device online</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>rate_limited</code></td><td><code>retry</code></td><td>Too many requests; see <code>retryAfterMs</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>quota_exceeded</code></td><td><code>free_space</code></td><td>The collection is over its storage quota</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>too_large</code></td><td><code>fix_request</code></td><td>A request or file over its limit</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>upgrade_required</code></td><td><code>upgrade</code></td><td>This SDK version is too old for the replica or collection</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>outcome_unknown</code></td><td><code>resolve_outcome</code></td><td>A write’s outcome can’t be determined; read again and decide</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>cancelled</code></td><td><code>none</code></td><td>You cancelled the request</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>internal</code></td><td><code>contact_support</code></td><td>A bug; the request may be retried once</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</DocsLayout>
